t decisions quickly, excellent attention skills, understanding of technology. Acknowledge concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education, but argue that these may be less critical than lack of reliability data for others.\n\nThus my vote: Candidate C.\n\nNow produce public message: state recommendation, refer to Agent 3's shift, mention evidence, explain why C is best despite concerns, maybe ask for any additional info on C's crew cooperation.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nProceed."}
